An unclosed inline run in a line block reaches the end of the block

```
::: |
a `b
c d
:::
.
<div class="line-block">
  <p>a <code>b
c d</code></p>
</div>
```

```
a `b
c d
.
<p>a <code>b
c d</code></p>
```

```
::: |
a `b`
c d
:::
.
<div class="line-block">
  <p>a <code>b</code><br>
c d</p>
</div>
```

```
::: |
a $`x
c d
:::
.
<div class="line-block">
  <p>a <span class="math inline">\(x
c d\)</span></p>
</div>
```
